                    "id": "robotics",
                    "title": "Robotics",
                    "shortDescription": "We believe in robots that empower people to perform better. Exonetik’s MR actuators offer high dynamic performance, low friction, low inertia and ajustable impedance.",
                    "longDescription": "<p>We believe in robots that empower people to perform better. Current collaborative robots are limited in speed and payload to stay safe around people. With Exonetik’s MR actuator and robotic joint topology, we can offer a robot liberated from current constraints, while respecting safety measures.</p>\n<p>We have been trusted by the Canadian Space Agency and the Canadian National Research Council to develop innovative collaborative robotic solutions that enable people to achieve better results and solve complex challenges in space or in advanced manufacturing.</p>\n<p>Exonetik's MR actuators and robotic joints enable fast and safe lightweight robots with high dynamic performance, impact resistance, no friction or backlash, and extremely low-reflected inertia compared to conventional geared motors.<br />\n<br />\n</p>\n",
