                {
                    "id": "aerospace",
                    "title": "Aerospace",
                    "shortDescription": "<p>Our high-speed and force-dense actuators bring value to a number of applications in the aerospace sector in form of new high-performance solutions.</p>",
                    "longDescription": "<p>We are a trusted partner for clients in the Aerospace sector, where our high-speed and force-dense actuators can ensure safety features and bring value in form of new high-performance solutions.</p>\n<p>In collaboration with Bell Flight, we are currently adding haptic feedback to helicopter controls and seats with our magnetorheological actuators to give pilots an understanding of the helicopter’s condition through the transmission of real-time tactile signals to their hands and back. Our technology gives pilots better situational awareness of the flight envelope. As a result, there will be less need for maintenance on helicopters as fewer pilots will unknowingly exceed rotorcraft limits.</p>",
