                {
                    "id": "automotive",
                    "title": "Automotive",
                    "shortDescription": "<p>We help clients turn passive applications into active high-performance applications, such as vibration cancellation in active seats and road bump cancellation in active vehicle suspensions.</p>",
                    "longDescription": "<p>Exonetik is a key partner in the automotive industry. We offer value-adding technological solutions to respond to our customers’ requirements by turning passive applications into active high-performance applications, such as vibration cancellation in active seats and road bump cancellation in active vehicle suspensions. Our MR actuators increase vehicle and road safety and give the end-user a better and more smooth driving experience.</p>\n<p>With Magna International, Exonetik has created an Active Seat Suspension System with our MR actuators reducing the vibrations of the seat with up to 78% on rough roads. Our suspension system will have a significant impact on the truck industry and the quality of life of truck drivers. Annual revenue losses of the trucking industry are estimated at $1.4bn due to health issues including musculoskeletal disorder caused by vibrations induced by the road.</p>",
