                {
                    "id": "medical-human-performance",
                    "title": "Medical & Human Performance",
                    "shortDescription": "<p>In rehabilitation, fitness and medical devices, Exonetik MR actuators can provide a better feeling for the end-user as our technology follows the human motion and gives a transparent assistance or restriction.</p>",
                    "longDescription": "<p>In rehabilitation, medical or fitness devices, Exonetik MR actuators can provide a better feeling for the end-user as our technology follows the human motion and gives a transparent assistance or restriction. </p>\n<p>In rehabilitation, MR actuators enable real time force feedback and data collection allowing the caregiver to go further into their therapeutic interventions in a safe manner while measuring patient progress. Among the benefits of our technology are less physical work for the therapist, faster progression of the patient, measuring patient progress (Data driven with AI possibility), going further into the therapeutic interventions, and allowing a larger exercises variety.</p>",
                    "images": {
                        "home": [
                            {
                                "alt": null,
                                "photo": {
                                    "1x": "https://s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/exonetik/assets-prod/_427x437_crop_center-center_none/Human-performance-droite@3x-compressed.jpg",
